{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.poster.avif?t=1753216524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.webm?t=1753216524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/9be4b668d636cd3db47239eac25f3c0c.mp4?t=1753216524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>About</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sky has been stolen, and only you as one of three physics breaking bunnies, can bring it back. <br><br>In Coco's Revenge, you\u2019ll hop, phase, and rotate your way through a retro 2D precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Shift between positive and negative space, and rotate entire stages with the help of your fairy friend to set the fastest stage times possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on tough challenges and stare down bosses, all in the name of saving the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.poster.avif?t=1753216524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.webm?t=1753216524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/29322a6690e562c964c40e4aac09744a.mp4?t=1753216524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\